     "titulo": "An -i adjective connects with くて; a -na adjective connects with で.",
     "texto": [
      "You can join two descriptions: おいしくて安い (tasty and cheap), きれいで静か (pretty and quiet). The final adjective carries the tense of the whole sentence.",
